    <string name="hajj_companion_nahr_msg">Eid al-Adha: Jamarat al-Aqabah kawu tulur\'a, sada\'a sadin, kəlzayin au kamzayin, daji Tawaf al-Ifadah-a Sai-a sadin.</string>
